<title>POLAND: Exbud 1996 group net up to PLN 11.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Exbud 1996 group net up to PLN 11.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exbud SA consolidated preliminary results for the financial year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>							 1996	   1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit		     6.76   vs    7.05</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit			12.85   vs   13.61</p>
<p>    Group net profit			    11.31   vs   10.72</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Exbud SA.</p>
<p>    Group net sales			    311.22   vs  198.58</p>
<p>    Group costs of sales		     281.82   vs  176.40</p>
<p>    Group extraordinary loss		   0.00   vs    0.01</p>
<p>    Group income tax			     1.54   vs    2.90</p>
<p>    Group other taxes			    0.00   vs    0.00</p>
<p>    Group financial revenues		  22.88   vs   17.38</p>
<p>    Group financial costs		     18.29   vs   10.99</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
